<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,374.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,374.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 3 Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,374 today from 1,367 on Jan 31, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route  Index    Rate     Prev Index  Rate</p>
